## Replication checklist for the mobile app

1. **Add `organizationClient({})` to the mobile auth client** — `apps/mobile/src/lib/auth-client.ts` currently only has `expoClient`.
2. List leagues via either `authClient.organization.list()` / `useListOrganizations()` or tRPC `trpc.league.list` (the latter includes `role`).
3. Track active league from session: `session.session.activeOrganizationId`.
4. Switch via `authClient.organization.setActive({ organizationId | organizationSlug })`, then invalidate org-scoped queries.
5. Server-side persistence across logins is already handled (`user_preference.lastActiveOrganizationId`, set in `databaseHooks.session.update.after` at `better-auth.ts:213-231`).
6. `activeOrgProcedure` tRPC calls on mobile will automatically scope to the session's active org (no extra headers needed; bearer token works via `expo()` + `bearer()` plugins).
